    <innerclass refid="classStmI2cDevice" prot="public">StmI2cDevice</innerclass>
    <innerclass refid="classStmI2cBus" prot="public">StmI2cBus</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>STM32 I2C Bus+Device wrapper — wraps STM32 HAL I2C via CubeMX handle. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Bus/Device architecture matching the ESP32 pattern:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classStmI2cBus" kindref="compound">StmI2cBus</ref>: wraps one I2C_HandleTypeDef*, manages device collection</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classStmI2cDevice" kindref="compound">StmI2cDevice</ref>: inherits <ref refid="classBaseI2c" kindref="compound">BaseI2c</ref>, delegates to parent bus HAL handle</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
